  "solution": {
    "text": "Chloroxylenol, also known as para-chloro-meta-xylenol (PCMX), is an antiseptic and disinfectant which is used for skin disinfection and cleaning surgical instruments. It is also used within a number of household disinfectants and wound cleaners. It is less effective than some other available agents. It is available as a liquid and sold with name Dettol.<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/633979.JPG\" style=\"width: 117px; height: 183px;\" />",
